                    <span class="app-pick-pill neutral">Best Offline Bedtime Story Companion for Young Kids</span>
                    <h3 style="margin-top: 0.6rem !important;">5. Nighty Night! (by Fox &amp; Sheep)</h3>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="app-specs-bar">
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-child"></i> Ages 1–5</span>
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-tag"></i> Paid App (No Login)</span>
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i> 100% Offline Bedtime Ritual</span>
                </div>
                <p>
                  When active daytime learning in Khan Academy Kids winds down and it is time to get ready for sleep, <a
                    href="https://www.foxandsheep.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nighty Night!</a> by
                  Fox &amp; Sheep (designed by Oscar-nominated animator Heidi Wittlinger) is a magical offline
                  storybook companion for toddlers and preschoolers.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Why it stands out:</strong> Children visit each glowing room of a cozy winter farmhouse and tap
                  the light switch to tuck sleepy animals (a dog, pig, sheep, duck, cow, and fish) into bed. With soft
                  lullaby music, soothing narration in multiple languages, and zero accounts required, it brings a calm,
                  predictable close to evening screen time.
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- 6. MERLIN BIRD ID -->
              <div class="app-review-card">
                <div class="app-review-header">
                  <div>
                    <span class="app-pick-pill neutral">Best Free Real-World Science App for Families</span>
